description = "Tear a fissure toward your cursor. Kraken tentacles burst from it in a wave that hits and stuns each enemy once, smashes weak scenery and ends in a giant tentacle. They then guard the line for 6 seconds, whipping nearby enemies. Earned by defeating Captain Blubberbeard."
